  "about": "What a cell of each field kind stores when a writer sends a value: the server's registry (business/FieldTypes) and the web's (lib/fieldTypes) are each held to these, byte for byte the same file in both repositories. A case with typed true is text a person types into the web's editor, which the web reads in the case's locale (whose number signs are signs) before it sends it; every case is what the server stores from any writer. want is the stored value; error true is a refusal.",
